description.para:
This signature is deliberately identical to i2c_writeRegMultipleBytes()/ i2c_readRegMultipleBytes() in drivers/i2c/i2cWrapper.h, so they can be passed to ina745a_initialize() directly via a function-pointer cast, e.g.: ina745a_initialize(addr,(ina745a_i2c_write_f)i2c_writeRegMultipleBytes,
(ina745a_i2c_read_f)i2c_readRegMultipleBytes,i2cHandle);
 (same pattern already used for si5332 with i2c_writeReg/i2c_readReg). No adapter module is required.
